	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "TI LM53601LQDSXRQ1 (1A sibling of the LM53600, identical DSX0010A package and pinout), WSON-10 DSX0010A 3x3mm 0.5mm pitch with exposed thermal pad (11). Land per TI SNAS660D DSX0010A example board layout: pins 0.6x0.25 at 2.8 span, EP 1.65x2.4. TI also lands the four 0.25mm tie-bar tabs at the package ends; they are omitted here (exposed tie-bar ends need no land) so traces can pass close to the package ends. Paste: two 1.5x0.98 EP windows (74 pct; TI shows 80 pct with a 0.2mm gap, widened to 0.36mm so 0.3mm vias on the centre row stay clear).")
	(tags "WSON DSX0010A LM53601 LM53600 buck")
